            "review_title": "Review at Pho Cao Van",
            "review_text": "Robert W\nSingapore, Singapore1755 contributions\n0\nDose of Pho in HCMC\nSep 2024 • Friends\nPho . A must have when in Vietnam. One of the recommended Pho shops by the locals . Walking distance from Novotel Center Saigon in District 3. Do not expect aircon or ‘ restaurants’ . It’s local coffee or noodle shop and the pho can be as good if not better than many places . Tried the beef noodle and it’s better than expected. Table sharing is common . Wear comfortable airy tees as it can be hot … both in the coffee shop or by the 5-foot ways. Recommend to try , well worth the experience! A place I will return to when in HCMC next\nRead more\nWritten September 29, 2024",
