            "review_text": "Francis W\nHong Kong, China112 contributions\n0\nQuite a nice pho restaurant\nDec 2019 • Couples\nWe stayed in the boundary between District 1 and 3. Like most Vietnam ko visitors, one should not miss enjoying the pho.\n\nWe searched the web and found this small shop which appears to be the locals' favour. It is cheap (VND55,000 for a big bowl) and I like its soup more than in Pho Le as it has a lighter favour. It goes with a good portion of meat and was cooked by a grandma.\n\nWe love it so much we went there again in the last night we stayed in HCMC and it did not disappoint us either.\nRead more\nWritten December 25, 2019",
