            "review_text": "desiremmwekb10\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam2964 contributions\n0\nQuite delicious Pho\nNov 2018 • Solo\nYou can find a good quality, delicious bowl of Pho here. In term of taste, it's a mix between the Northern and Saigon. The rare beef is tender, the beef brisket has the right mix of fat and lean meat, quite tasty. The broth is fabulous. The only negative thing about this place is the space is quite small and hot when it's packed, not good ventilation. As for the Pho, worth it.\nRead more\nWritten November 2, 2018",
