            "review_text": "hippokathy88\nPerth, Australia172 contributions\n0\nBest phở in town\nSep 2017 • Solo\nBest phở in town in my book! If you like Northern-styled phở for its simplicity and Southern-styled phở for its richness in flavour then this is the best of both worlds. I love phở here because of how delicate the soup is, you're able to taste the sweetness from the bone yet the right amount of spices manages to create an unphogettable full-bodied broth experience. It's hard to put the magical taste into words, you just gotta get here and have a bowl yourself. Make sure you get a handful of fresh herbs in there! 👌😍🌿👌\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 12, 2017",
