            "review_text": "OliverL311\nSingapore, Singapore163 contributions\n0\nIncredible pho! Popular with the locals\nDec 2016 • Family\nWe came by this place when searching for pho when we first landed in ho chi Minh city. Definitely satiated our stomachs with incredible pho, with an amazing broth and a very very generous portion of beef and herbs. All round amazing dining experience. Be prepared to be eating in a rather dirty place! But it should be expected when you're here in Ho Chi Minh. One of the best phos I've eaten ever. \n\n45000 VND for each bowl of pho tai or pho ga. Might seem a bit steep, but for the amount of meat and herbs it's a bargain.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 30, 2016",
